{"title":"Career Roadmap · PLM Specialist","role":"PLM Specialist","summary":"A PLM (Product Lifecycle Management) Specialist manages the digital information, processes, workflows, and systems used to take a product from concept and engineering design through manufacturing, service, and end-of-life.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. — Engineering & Technology","Course":"Digital Manufacturing & Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PLM (Product Lifecycle Management) Specialist manages the digital information, processes, workflows, and systems used to take a product from concept and engineering design through manufacturing, service, and end-of-life."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits between engineering, manufacturing, IT, supply chain, and product development."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Managing product structures and BOMs"},{"text":"Administering PLM platforms"},{"text":"Managing engineering documents and revisions"},{"text":"Configuring workflows and approval processes"},{"text":"Supporting CAD/PDM integration"},{"text":"Managing Engineering Change Requests/Orders"},{"text":"Maintaining product data integrity"},{"text":"Supporting digital manufacturing processes"},{"text":"Integrating PLM with ERP/MES systems"},{"text":"Training engineering and manufacturing users"},{"text":"Improving product-development workflows"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Common PLM ecosystems include Siemens Teamcenter, Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE/ENOVIA, PTC Windchill, and SAP-related product lifecycle solutions."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E.","PLM / Engineering Data Intern","PLM Specialist / PLM Analyst","PLM Consultant / PLM Engineer","Senior PLM Consultant","PLM Solution Architect","PLM Program Manager / Enterprise PLM Architect"]},{"type":"table","header":["